id: F17
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feInvert: addition-chain iteration-count off-by-one, 'for i in 1..<5: feSq(t2, t2)' -> '1..<4', short-circuiting one squaring in the Fermat-little-theorem exponent ladder.
====OLD====
  for i in 1..<5:
    feSq(t2, t2)
====NEW====
  for i in 1..<4:
    feSq(t2, t2)
====END====
